t the game is about, what you want and how you want to run it. Give as an Agency, a main players. Something to hook us in. Otherwise, meh.</div> </div> </div> </div>I have class Tuesday till Friday. Sunday I play Shadowrun,Scion or Cthulhu tech in real life. Unless Saturday you guy's wanted to play super late or super early it would be hard. or late on Fridays like after 10pm EST","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","name":"Basic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1540_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"777"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-14T21:16:01-07:00","id":113122,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>miss_minty</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/100949-still-looking-for-a-demon-the-descent-game?p=112950#post112950\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'll bite, and I'll try not to sound catty at the same time. We love Demon, tremendously. We all wanna pick up and play the moment we get the chance.<br /> I think one of the issue's is your scheduling time, it's arbitrary. 5 pm est on a Monday? That's 2pm where I am. So any interest I'd have is nixed, and Monday really? Not like a Friday night or Saturday/ Sunday?<br /> And the second thing is, is that you're not giving us much to consider. New York, great what else? Just because Demon has a specific theme doesn't mean that every character created will mesh well into your world. Say I make a character, and I really dig being a Sabatuer and build her around wanting to Raze infrastructure with horrible zeal. But once the game get's going it's clear that I'm both way out of my league and you want everything to stay on the down low or even make Sabatuers or a disdained batch. Off the bat, my character is useless at best.<br /> People have posted asking you what the game is about, what you want and how you want to run it. Give as an Agency, a main players. Something to hook us in. Otherwise, meh.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> For me I can run the game off your characters background once I see what type they are and everything. I also wanted to run it semi sandbox. So build what ever you want. I will tailor the story then.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","name":"Basic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1540_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"777"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-14T21:26:54-07:00","id":113125,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>miss_minty</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/100949-still-looking-for-a-demon-the-descent-game?p=112950#post112950\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'll bite, and I'll try not to sound catty at the same time. We love Demon, tremendously. We all wanna pick up and play the moment we get the chance.<br /> I think one of the issue's is your scheduling time, it's arbitrary